A Shuttle era photograph from a United Space Alliance contact, shared by NASA Spaceflight,

00:05:13.905 --> 00:05:17.865
shows pad operations at Cape Canaveral in the 1980s and 90s.

00:05:17.865 --> 00:05:23.085
Sci-Guy space in a post that has not been independently confirmed, corrected an earlier

00:05:23.085 --> 00:05:28.465
take and said the space launch system, or SLS, core stage will remain in service into

00:05:28.465 --> 00:05:33.485
the 2030s after NASA dropped the exploration upper stage from near-term plans.

00:05:34.369 --> 00:05:39.889
Worth keeping an eye on is a Louisiana lawsuit that challenges a reported $100 billion tax

00:05:39.889 --> 00:05:45.289
incentive package for the new Starbase site, alleging the agreement was negotiated without

00:05:45.289 --> 00:05:50.509
the public disclosure the law requires, according to TradingView. Plaintiffs want the deal

00:05:50.509 --> 00:05:56.009
voided on procedural grounds. This is the first formal court test of how the project is financed.

00:05:56.469 --> 00:06:01.349
The complaint lists state officials and SpaceX as parties, and asks a court to examine

00:06:01.349 --> 00:06:07.604
those closed door talks. Fast rendezvous is the engineering reality of matching plane and phase

00:06:07.604 --> 00:06:13.104
with almost no spare propellant, and Grace's hop only works if that match is already in the sky

00:06:13.104 --> 00:06:19.444
when the window opens. Dragon flu phasing burns, small nudges that change catch-up rate until

00:06:19.444 --> 00:06:25.044
the argument of Paragee, the orbit's low-point location, and the nodal alignment, where the orbit

00:06:25.044 --> 00:06:32.444
crosses the equator, match the station at arrival. The station travels at roughly 7.66 km per second.

00:06:32.964 --> 00:06:38.644
At an altitude on the order of 400 km, that speed gives a period of roughly 93 minutes.

00:06:38.644 --> 00:06:43.944
events, even a small miss in launch asmeth or upper stage cutoff, then slides relative

00:06:43.944 --> 00:06:49.144
phasing by hundreds of kilometers per orbit, so the hop needed an on-time liftoff and

00:06:49.144 --> 00:06:51.604
a second stage that left the right energy in plain.

00:06:52.324 --> 00:06:57.684
Earlier US crewed flights averaged 12-14 hours because windows followed daylight and lighting,

00:06:58.144 --> 00:06:59.644
not minimum-time geometry.

00:07:00.364 --> 00:07:06.104
Soyuz docked in three hours in 2020 from a near-co planer Baikonor launch, while Florida's

00:07:06.104 --> 00:07:12.024
28-degree latitude, a 51.6-degree station inclination, and the Atlantic Range Safety

00:07:12.024 --> 00:07:14.584
Corridor historically forced longer coasts.

00:07:15.084 --> 00:07:19.864
If Starship refueling later lets crew leave from higher energy orbits, the same rules

00:07:19.864 --> 00:07:22.844
decide whether transit's fall below six hours as routine.

00:07:23.524 --> 00:07:28.244
The limiter is insertion-burned precision, and whether later phasing burns can fly with minimal

00:07:28.244 --> 00:07:29.244
propellant margin.

00:07:29.864 --> 00:07:35.044
A back-of-envelope plane change at that speed puts a half-degree error on the order of 67 meters

00:07:35.044 --> 00:07:38.284
per second, 2v times sine of half the angle.

00:07:38.844 --> 00:07:43.244
The previous US crewed minimum still needed multiple orbits to close the phase angle,

00:07:43.764 --> 00:07:47.804
and compressing it meant a tighter window and a Falcon 9 second stage that delivered

00:07:47.804 --> 00:07:49.244
a cleaner velocity vector.

00:07:49.864 --> 00:07:55.264
That trades operational flexibility for fewer hours in a small cabin, and future vehicles

00:07:55.264 --> 00:07:58.464
with more propellant could loosen the window and keep the short ride.

00:07:59.004 --> 00:08:02.684
The magic wand number is the cutoff vector, raw meters per second.

00:08:02.684 --> 00:08:07.844
Get it perfect, and the weight is just the phase angle already in the sky, and the idiot

00:08:07.844 --> 00:08:13.324
index on a long rendezvous is extra life support mass, many times the propellant a precise

00:08:13.324 --> 00:08:14.484
insertion would burn.

